Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 04:48:14 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 23/38] probe(kvcr): AISIM_KVCR_PROBE writes per-request KVCR
 diagnostics (off by default): at arrival and first G2 lookup, the leading
 prompt blocks the rank's own G2, the longest-holding peer's G2 and the hinted
 source's G2 hold; each staged pull's wanted and pulled blocks and stop
 reason; every 600 s a G2 snapshot (blocks per rank, distinct across the pool,
 held by two or more ranks)

